WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.800
Good morning, how is everyone? This is Diego Loria
from the company Degma, of the Gessi brand.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.800
Today we are using the Vigila machine from Hawit,

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.800
a colour sorter we have tested on different products
used in Argentina,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:24.800
or grown in Argentina: beans, wheat, adzuki beans,
white beans, black beans,

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.800
and we even tested it with small grains.
We have had very good results,

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:39.800
thanks also to the training from the Hawit team, who gave us
both advice and technical support to set it up properly.
